		Nvidia Orin Board Support Package

Table of Contents
=================

1. Supported Boards
2. Change History
3. BSP Features
4. BSP Notes


1. Supported Boards
===================

This BSP supports the following boards:

   + Nvidia Jetson AGX Orin developer kit - tegra234-p3737-0000+p3701-0005
   
2. Change History
=================
  - 2024/06: Wind River Linux 10.22 RCPL17. Standard 64bit Linux
  - SDK: Nvidia Jetpack 6.0 (Production release) & meta-tegra (wip-l4t-r36.3.0)


3. BSP Features
===============

3.1 Supported Features
======================

The following BSP features are validated and supported.

  o Bus
	+ 8 x I2C
	+ 4 x UART
	+ 3 x SPI
	+ 4 x USB
	+ GPIO
	+ UPHY: Up to 2 x8, 1 x4, 2 x1 (PCIe Gen4, Root Port & Endpoint)
	
  o Network
	+ Ethernet: 1 x 1GbE
	
  o Memory & Storage
	+ 64GB eMMC
	+ 64MB NOR Boot Flash
	+ 64GB 256-bit LPDDR5 DRAM
	+ Video decode
	+ Display: 1x 8K60 multi-mode DP 1.4a (+MST)
	
  o Multimedia
	+ USB Camera
    + Programmable Vision Accelerator v2.0

  o Misc Devices
    + 2 x DLA - NVDLA v2.0

3.2 Unsupported Features
========================

The following features are not supported and not validated same as SDK.

	x CAN
	x I2S
	x DMIC
	x DSPK
	x Ethernet: 1 x 10GbE
	x D-PHY 2.1 (up to 40Gbps for 32GB Orin) | C-PHY 2.0 (up to 164Gbps for 64GB Orin)
	x Gen 4.2 Video Imaging Compositor (VIC) 2D Engine
	x CSI Camera: Up to 6 cameras (16 via virtual channels) 16 lanes MIPI CSI-2

4. BSP Notes
============

4.1 Target Notes
----------------

NOTE: This BSP is only validated in the following environment with booting from
eMMC, if used in a different environment it may run into unknown issues.

4.1.1 Validated Board Info
--------------------------

	Processor:		Nvidia Jetson AGX Orin
	Board:			Nvidia Jetson AGX Orin Developer kit
	BootLoader:		Jetson UEFI firmware
	BootLoader Version:	36.3.0

